meta {
  name: Update enrollment
  type: http
  seq: 15
}

patch {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/enrollments/{{enrollmentId}}
  body: json
  auth: inherit
}

headers {
  X-School-Id: {{schoolCode}}
}

body:json {
  {
    "roll_number": "07"
  }
}

assert {
  res.status: eq 200
  res.body.roll_number: eq "07"
  res.body.section_id: eq {{sectionId}}
  res.body.status: eq active
}

docs {
  Roll numbers get reissued once a class settles, so this is the ordinary
  edit. What is deliberately absent from the body is student_id: an enrolment
  cannot be moved to a different pupil, because the mark sheets and the
  attendance already hanging off it would silently follow.

  The write is narrowed the same way the read is, and by the same rule: a row
  this caller cannot reach answers 404, never 403.
}
